# core/data/talk/grammar/en/rom_ask.tlk - more replies to ASK_OUT (owner: TK; T5b package
# T5B-ROM). ADULTS ONLY, same rules as core_romance.tlk: every rule carries
# adults_only&!kid_present&!pet (lint TK3); a yes carries `consent`, a no carries `!consent`
# (K-5: the target's answer, decided by T6 and the sim; Talk never sets romance state).
# A no ends it on the spot, kindly, and the joke is on the one who asked only in the
# gentlest way, never on the one who said no. No sexual-class word, no register word, no
# flirt-class word (lint TK4/TK5), no topic echo, at most one exclamation mark a line
# outside the loud voice. Nobody here is a minor: minors get the safety banks.
# Syntax: core/tools/talkc_gen.py.

# ---- ASK_OUT: yes -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent act: yes
  "[LOVE]A date? Yes. Somewhere with soup and a back door."
  "Yes, please. I'll wear my second-best hat."
  "Sure. Pick the place, I'll pick the mood. It's going to be giddy."
  "Yes! Wait, I mean, yes. Casual, very casual yes."
  "I thought you'd never ask. I'd started to ask myself."
  "[LOVE]I'd love to. I'll bring the nerves, you bring the snacks."
  "Yes, just promise me no clowns. And no bees. Mostly no clowns."
  "Okay, yes, don't look at me. I'm happy. It's embarrassing."
  "A date with you? I'd say yes to worse. That came out wrong, it's a yes."
  "Yes, I'll even iron something. Anything. A sock."
  "[LOVE]Count me in. I'll be the one trying not to trip."
  "Yes. Somewhere quiet, with good lighting and bad music."
  "I'll go, on one condition. We split the dessert. Or I take it."
  "Absolutely. I'll tell my mirror to stop laughing."
  "Yes. Pick me up at seven. I'll be ready at eight, in spirit."
  "Hm, tempting. Yes. I've got a free evening and a dangerous crush."
  "Sure, why not. I trust your taste. It's not great, but I trust it."
  "[LOVE]Yes, and thank you for asking. You were brave. I was busy being cute."
  "A date, cool, totally cool. I'm fully calm. Look at how calm."
  "Yes, let's. I'll wear something nice and spill something on it."
  "Say less. Yes, I'll meet you there. I'll be early and pretend I wasn't."
  "Okay. Yes. My heart said yes first, and my brain is catching up."
  "[LOVE]I'd be delighted. I'm going to be so awkward. Delighted, though."
  "You're asking? You're asking. Yes, let me put down this soup."
  "Yes, and I'm picking the dessert. Nobody argues with the dessert."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_polite guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&polite act: yes
  "I'd be delighted. Do say when, and I'll say yes again."
  "How kind of you to ask. Yes, I'll bring a small gift. A biscuit."
  "[LOVE]It would be my pleasure. I'll try not to blush through dinner."
  "That's a lovely idea. Yes, thank you. I'll wear the nice cardigan."
  "Yes, with pleasure. I do hope you like soup."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_flat guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&flat act: yes
  "Yes, I'm thrilled. This is thrilled. Look at my face, it's trying."
  "Sure, A date. Great. I'm cartwheeling internally."
  "Okay. Yes. I'll be the one in the corner, smiling stiffly."
  "[LOVE]Yes. Note my enthusiasm. It's the quiet kind."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_loud guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&loud act: yes
  "YES! A date! Tell everyone, tell the ducks!"
  "Absolutely! I'll bring snacks and an unreasonable amount of energy!"
  "[LOVE]YES! I mean, yes. Quietly, nope, still yes!"
  "Woo! Book it! I'll wear the loud shirt!"
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_slow guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&slow act: yes
  "Mmm, {.}yes. {.}I'll need a minute to get excited about it. Starting now."
  "Oh, {.}A date. {.}Yes, I'd like that. Slowly."
  "[LOVE]Well. {.}Yes, {.}that sounds nice. I'll bring the good slippers."
  "Take me somewhere with chairs. And, yes, I'll go."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_quick guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&quick act: yes
  "Yes, absolutely, where, when, what do I wear, I'll wear anything."
  "A date? Yes, yes, perfect, I'll be there, I'm already outside."
  "[LOVE]Yes, quick, before I overthink it, yes."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_elder guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&elder act: yes
  "Well, now. I've still got my good shoes. Yes, dear."
  "[LOVE]At my age a date is a rare treat. I'll say yes before I'm too old."
  "Yes, if we're back by nine. My knees have a curfew."
  "A date, how lovely. I've not been asked in a century. A quiet century."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_blunt guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&blunt act: yes
  "Yes. Don't make it weird. Make it dinner."
  "Sure, I like you. Say something nice at dinner. I'll listen."
  "[LOVE]About time. Yes. Pick somewhere with real chairs."
  "Fine, yes. You've got guts. I'll bring my own fork."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_quirky guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&quirky act: yes
  "A date! I'll wear my second-best moustache. I mean my best coat."
  "[LOVE]Yes, my horoscope said something big would happen. It meant this. Or soup."
  "I'll bring a kazoo for the awkward gaps. Yes."
  "Yes. I'll practise my small talk on a very patient plant."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_hellborn guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&hellborn&!kid_speaker act: yes
  "Yes, I'll book us a table somewhere warm. Not that warm. Medium."
  "[LOVE]A date? Sure, I'll leave the pitchfork at home. Mostly."
  "Yes. I promise to keep the flames to a gentle simmer."
  "Dinner and a walk. Yes. I'll even try to keep my horns off the napkins."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_ghost guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&ghost act: yes
  "Yes. I'll haunt the restaurant politely. Mostly by the window."
  "[LOVE]A date with the living. How bold. Yes, I'll float over."
  "I'd love to. I can't eat, but I can nod. Well, bob."
  "Yes. Dinner for one and a half. Counting me."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_night guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&night act: yes
  "Yes. A date under these stars would be a fine thing."
  "[LOVE]A midnight date? Sure. The moon owes me a favour."
  "Yes. Tomorrow, then. I'll sleep through the nerves."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_friend guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&rel=friend act: yes
  "Oh! Yes, don't make it weird. Yes, make it a bit weird."
  "[LOVE]We're friends and now we're dating? Efficient. Yes."
  "I was hoping you'd ask. I've been practising my surprise."
  "Yes. If it goes badly we can go back to snacks."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_best guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&rel=best act: yes
  "Of course, you're my best friend. Now you're also my problem. Yes."
  "[LOVE]Yes. I think I've known for ages. I was just waiting for snacks."
  "I thought you'd never ask. I've bought a new shirt twice."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_partner guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&rel=partner act: yes
  "[LOVE]Of course. A night out with you? I'll find my good shoes."
  "Still asking. I love that. Yes, always."
  "Yes. Let's go somewhere with a menu we can't pronounce."
  "[LOVE]Again? Yes. You're my favourite repeat order."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_happy guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&mood=happy act: yes
  "[LOVE]I'm in a great mood and you've made it better. Yes."
  "Yes! My day was going so well, and now it has a date in it."
  "Of course. I'm smiling too hard to say no."
@rule core.ask_out.r_yes_nervous guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&mood=scared act: yes
  "Yes, I'm shaking. That's a yes shake. Probably."
  "[LOVE]A date. Okay, breathe. Yes, breathe again."
  "Yes. I'll be nervous. I'll be nervous nicely."
  "Yes. Please be patient. I'm very bad at this and very glad."

# ---- ASK_OUT: no -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.ask_out.r_no guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent act: no
  "Oh, no thanks. But that was brave. Gold star."
  "Thanks, but no. I hope you find a very nice someone."
  "That's a no from me. But thank you for asking so kindly."
  "I'll pass, sorry. You seem lovely. I'm just not the one."
  "No, but I'm flattered. I'll be flattered at home, alone."
  "A kind no. With a smile. And a small wave."
  "Sorry, not for me. Try the library. They love a brave soul."
  "I can't, I'm busy. Forever, unrelated to you. A bit related."
  "No, thank you. I'm saving that evening for a book and a blanket."
  "Oh, hm. No, but hats off to you. I'm not wearing a hat."
  "That's a no. Please enjoy this complimentary biscuit as a consolation."
  "Sorry, no. I hope you find someone who likes your jokes. I'm too tired."
  "No thanks, but I admire the nerve. Use it elsewhere."
  "Not me, friend. I'm told I'm hard to please and harder to date."
  "I appreciate it. And I'm saying no. Both are true."
  "Bless you. No. Go ask someone who'll say yes, and bring them a biscuit."
  "No, sorry. I've got plans. They're boring plans, but they're mine."
  "Aw, no. But it's a lovely idea. Pass it on to someone free."
  "A polite no from me. Please accept this firm, friendly handshake."
  "I'd say maybe, but that'd be unkind. So, no. Kindly."
@rule core.ask_out.r_no_polite guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&polite act: no
  "How kind of you to ask. I'm afraid I must decline, with real thanks."
  "I'm honoured, truly. And I'm declining. Do have a lovely evening."
  "Thank you, but no. May I offer you a scone as consolation?"
  "That's very thoughtful, but I shall have to say no. Warmly."
  "I'm so sorry, no. You deserve someone enthusiastic. I'm lukewarm tea."
@rule core.ask_out.r_no_blunt guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&blunt act: no
  "No, not into it. Good luck, though. I mean it."
  "Nope, that's a no. A real no. Please don't turn it into a project."
  "No. I respect the effort. I don't respect the date."
  "I'll be honest. No, you're fine. It's just no."
@rule core.ask_out.r_no_flat guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&flat act: no
  "No, thanks, though. This is my sad voice. It's very close to my happy one."
  "Hm, no. Not personal. I'm just a no kind of person today."
  "Sorry. No, that was gentle. I practised."
@rule core.ask_out.r_no_loud guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&loud act: no
  "NOPE! But that was brave, so cheer for yourself!"
  "No thanks! Give me a high five anyway! A kind one!"
  "Aw, no! But you're a champ! Go get 'em somewhere else!"
@rule core.ask_out.r_no_slow guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&slow act: no
  "Hm, {.}that's sweet. {.}No, sorry. Have a good evening."
  "Oh. {.}I'm flattered, but no. {.}Thank you, though."
@rule core.ask_out.r_no_quick guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&quick act: no
  "Thanks, no, sorry, lovely, bye, thanks, bye."
  "No, no, kind, flattered, can't, got to go, bye."
@rule core.ask_out.r_no_elder guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&elder act: no
  "Oh, you're sweet. But I'm too old and too fond of my slippers."
  "No, dear. I'd only fall asleep in the soup."
  "Thank you, but I've had my share. Go and try the young ones."
@rule core.ask_out.r_no_sad guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&mood=sad act: no
  "Thank you for asking. I'm not in a place for it. Maybe not for a while."
  "No, but it's kind. I'm a bit low. Let's just have a cup of tea."
@rule core.ask_out.r_no_friend guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&rel=friend act: no
  "Aw, no, I like you too much as a friend. It's a compliment. Honest."
  "I'd rather keep you as a friend. Dating you would ruin my snacks."
  "No. But please stay my friend. I've grown attached to your company."
@rule core.ask_out.r_no_partner guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&rel=partner act: no
  "Not tonight, love. I'm wiped. Let's rain-check, with soup."
  "Not this time. Tonight I'm a sofa. Come be a sofa too."

# ---- ASK_OUT: deflect, joke ---------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.ask_out.r_deflect guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent act: deflect_romance
  "That's very kind, but no. Maybe a coffee, as friends."
  "I'm going to say no, then change the subject. Weather's nice."
  "Hm, not like that. But you've got good taste in people. Mostly."
  "Oh dear. Sorry, no. Let's pretend I tripped and fell over."
  "I'm not ready for that. Can we talk about pie?"
  "I'd say it's not you, but I'm tired of that line. It's a bit you."
  "Too fast, friend. Way too fast. I'm still on the greeting."
  "Hm, no, but the gesture was lovely. Keep the gesture. Lose the date."
  "I'll politely decline and then look at a tree for a bit."
  "No. But thank you. I'll tell my cat you asked."
@rule core.ask_out.r_deflect_polite guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&polite act: deflect_romance
  "Forgive me, but I must decline. Do let me offer you tea instead."
  "You're most kind, but I'm afraid not. Let's leave it there, warmly."
  "I'm quite flattered. And quite unavailable. May we speak of the weather?"
@rule core.ask_out.r_deflect_blunt guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&blunt act: deflect_romance
  "No, next topic. I'll start. Do you like soup?"
  "Not happening. But thanks. Seriously, now, snacks."
@rule core.ask_out.r_joke guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent act: joke
  "A date? I'll check my calendar. It's blank, it's always blank, yes."
  "Is this a date, or a very elaborate way to avoid doing dishes?"
  "Sure. I'll even pretend to like your taste in food."
  "I'd say yes, but I need to consult my other self. He says yes too."
  "A date with you? Will there be snacks? There'd better be snacks, yes."
  "I'll go, but I'm not picking the restaurant. Last time I picked the pier."
  "Dinner? Sure, I can eat dinner. I'm very good at it."
  "You're asking me? In public? You monster, yes."
@rule core.ask_out.r_joke_quirky guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&quirky act: joke
  "A date, yes. I'll bring a map, a spoon and my biggest hat."
  "Accepted. I shall prepare a speech. It's mostly hums."
  "I'll go on a date with you. I'll even leave the cactus at home."

# ---- CONFESS: yes (feeling returned) -----------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.confess.r_yes guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent act: answer
  "[LOVE]Oh. Me too. I've been rehearsing this reply for weeks."
  "You mean that? Sit down, I need to hug something. You'll do."
  "[LOVE]I feel the same. It's annoying how much. Come here."
  "I was hoping you'd say that. I'd rather you said it first, so I did nothing."
  "Oh, that's lovely. And true, and also terrifying. All three, please."
  "[LOVE]You've said it. I'm saying it too. Let's be a mess together."
  "I was going to tell you, but I forgot how words work."
  "Me too. I've liked you since the soup. I never told you about the soup."
  "That's the nicest thing anyone's said to me. I'm not exaggerating. Much."
  "Oh, good. I mean, wow. I mean, me too."
  "I've been waiting for you to say that. I had snacks prepared and everything."
  "[LOVE]Same here. I'd say more, but I'm busy grinning."
  "You've made my entire week, my entire year, and my entire face."
  "Don't tell me you mean it unless you mean it. Oh good, you do."
  "Heavens, I feel it too. Pass the fan. And your hand."
  "Honestly, I thought it was just me. It's both of us. Wild."
  "[LOVE]I'm glad you said it. I was about to write a very bad poem."
  "I like you too. A lot, don't ask me how much. I'll cry."
@rule core.confess.r_yes_polite guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&polite act: answer
  "[LOVE]That's so lovely to hear. I feel exactly the same, if I may say."
  "I'm quite overcome. And quite in agreement. Do sit with me."
  "How wonderful. I share the sentiment entirely, and a little more."
  "You've honoured me. I feel the same. Shall we have some tea about it?"
@rule core.confess.r_yes_flat guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&flat act: answer
  "Oh, huh. Me too, that's my happy voice. It's very quiet."
  "[LOVE]I feel the same. I'd show it, but my face has a policy."
  "Good. I like you too. Please accept my restrained joy."
@rule core.confess.r_yes_loud guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&loud act: answer
  "ME TOO! I mean it! Come here, you lovely idiot!"
  "[LOVE]WOW! I feel it too! The whole park should know!"
  "You're kidding! Me too! Let's tell everyone!"
@rule core.confess.r_yes_slow guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&slow act: answer
  "[LOVE]Oh. {.}Me too. {.}I've been trying to say it for ages."
  "That's lovely. {.}I feel it too. {.}Give me a moment to glow."
  "Mmm, {.}me too. {.}Slowly, properly. Like good soup."
@rule core.confess.r_yes_quick guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&quick act: answer
  "Me too, I love it, yes, me too, hold on, I'm going to faint."
  "[LOVE]Same, same, so same, I can't say it fast enough."
@rule core.confess.r_yes_elder guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&elder act: answer
  "[LOVE]Oh, I never thought I'd hear that again. I feel the same, dear."
  "Well. A late bloom, but a good one. I feel it too."
  "My heart's too old for fuss, and yet it's fussing. Me too."
@rule core.confess.r_yes_blunt guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&blunt act: answer
  "[LOVE]Good. Same. Don't make a speech about it."
  "Yeah. Me too. Took you long enough."
  "I feel it too. There, I said it. Don't tell anyone."
@rule core.confess.r_yes_quirky guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&quirky act: answer
  "[LOVE]My heart's a pigeon and you just whistled. Yes, me too."
  "You like me? I like you back. It's a boomerang, A big, soft one."
  "Roses are red. I feel the same. I'd rhyme, but I'm overwhelmed."
@rule core.confess.r_yes_awkward guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&mood=scared act: answer
  "[LOVE]Me too, I'm sorry. I'm sweating. It's a happy sweat."
  "Oh no, I mean, oh yes. Me too. I'm going to need to sit."
  "I feel it too. I'm very bad at this. I'm very glad, too."
  "Wow, okay. Me too. I'll just stand here and vibrate."
@rule core.confess.r_yes_friend guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&rel=friend act: answer
  "[LOVE]Oh no. I mean, oh good. I feel the same, you absolute menace."
  "I thought it was just me. You're my friend and now you're all of this."
  "I've liked you for ages. I thought I'd keep it. I can't."
@rule core.confess.r_yes_partner guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&rel=partner act: answer
  "[LOVE]And I love you. Still, again. Every day, with extra cheese."
  "You say it so well. I'm still not used to it. I hope I never am."
  "I love you too. I've known for ages. I just like hearing it."

# ---- CONFESS: no (a kind refusal), break-up -------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.confess.r_no guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent act: deflect_romance
  "That's sweet, but no. Thank you for telling me. It took courage."
  "I'm touched, and I can't return it. I'm sorry. Let's stay friends."
  "Oh dear. Thank you, but no. I hope you find your someone."
  "I appreciate you saying it. I just don't feel it. I'm sorry."
  "It's lovely to be liked. It's not mutual. I'm sorry, biscuit?"
  "That's brave of you. I can't match it. I'm going to sit for a bit."
  "Thank you. I'm flattered, and it's a no. I won't make it weird."
  "I wish I could say yes. I can't. You deserve better than a maybe."
  "I'm honoured. And I'm sorry. It's a no, but a warm one."
  "I can't feel that way. I hope we can keep saying hello."
@rule core.confess.r_no_polite guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&polite act: deflect_romance
  "That's very dear of you. I'm afraid I can't return it. Do forgive me."
  "I'm truly touched. But no. May I make you a cup of tea instead?"
@rule core.confess.r_no_blunt guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&blunt act: deflect_romance
  "No, I'm sorry, I don't feel that. I won't pretend. You'd hate me."
  "I appreciate it. It's a no, don't hang around hoping. Go find a snack."
@rule core.confess.r_no_flat guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&flat act: deflect_romance
  "Oh, thank you. I don't feel it back. I'm sorry, it's quiet in here."
  "Hm, I'm not there. I'm sorry. This is my kind face."
@rule core.confess.r_no_elder guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&elder act: deflect_romance
  "Oh, that's sweet, dear. I'm past all that. Give it to someone with knees."
  "Bless you. No. But keep that heart open, somewhere it can breathe."
@rule core.confess.r_no_sad guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&mood=sad act: deflect_romance
  "Thank you for saying it. I can't right now. I'm sorry, I'm not well."
  "I wish I could. I'm just not there. Let's have tea, if that helps."
@rule core.confess.r_split guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&rel=partner act: deflect_romance
  "I think we've run out of road. I'm sorry. It's me, and the road."
  "I care about you. I can't be what you need. I'm so sorry."
  "We had a good run. A very good run. I need to stop running."
  "It's been lovely. It isn't now. Can we be kind about it?"
  "I don't want to end it with a fight. So, here's a hug. Goodbye."
  "I think we both know. Let's part before we start to hate the soup."
  "I'm sorry. I love you, and I can't stay. That's the whole sentence."
  "We'll always have the park. And the bad fountain. I'll visit it."
  "I need space. Not far. Just enough for my knees to breathe."
@rule core.confess.r_split_polite guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&rel=partner&polite act: deflect_romance
  "I owe you the truth, and I'm sorry. I think we ought to part. Gently."
  "Thank you for everything. I believe it's time to say goodbye."
@rule core.confess.r_split_blunt guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&rel=partner&blunt act: deflect_romance
  "It's over, I'm sorry. I'll say why if you want. I'd rather not."
  "We're done. I mean it kindly. Take the good spoons, I'll take the bad."
@rule core.confess.r_split_sad guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&rel=partner&mood=sad act: deflect_romance
  "I can't do this any more. I'm so sorry. I wish it were different."
  "I'm not good for you right now. I need to step away. I'm sorry."

# ---- CONFESS: joke, confess back, awkward crush --------------------------------------------------
@rule core.confess.r_joke guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent act: joke
  "Wow, that's the nicest thing today. The bar was a dead bird. Still nice."
  "Is this the part where I say something clever? I've got nothing. Hi."
  "You're good at this. My therapist will be so proud and so confused."
  "That took guts. I'd clap, but I'm holding a sandwich."
  "I'll be honest. I've got a speech. It's one word, it's yes."
  "You said it, so now I have to say something. I'm blank. Wow."
  "I'd say something deep, but I'm distracted by your face."
  "That was lovely. Do it again. I'll take notes this time."
@rule core.confess.r_confess guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent act: confess
  "[LOVE]I like you. A lot, there. I said it, please look away."
  "You're the best thing in this park. And I've seen the fountain."
  "I've had a crush on you since the soup. I've never told anyone about the soup."
  "[LOVE]I think I'm falling. Please catch me. Or at least cushion me."
  "I like you more than my own jokes. That's the most I can say."
  "You make my day lighter and my knees weaker. Which is unfair."
  "I think about you more than is polite. Or healthy. Mostly healthy."
